description=Fixes the No Catch bug in Build 42 multiplayer fishing: the bait unequips in the middle of the fight and the catch turns into No Catch, with no fish, no XP, and the line worn down anyway. On a server it usually looks like only the first angler can land anything - that is the same bug. Also fixes the Fishing Panel in multiplayer: the caught-fish list that empties every session and the error spam. No balance changes.
